        <briefdescription>
<para>Retrieve wiki chunks for the query in <computeroutput>ctx</computeroutput> and populate <computeroutput>StageResult</computeroutput>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Retrieve From Wiki.</para>
<para>This method satisfies the <computeroutput>RAGStageHandler</computeroutput> type alias and may be assigned directly to <computeroutput>ModularRAGPipelineConfig::retrieve_fn</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>Steps:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Calls <computeroutput>reader.query(ctx.query, config_.top_k, config_.min_score)</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Converts each <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1_wiki_chunk" kindref="compound">WikiChunk</ref></computeroutput> to a <computeroutput>RAGCandidate</computeroutput> with <computeroutput>source_namespace = config_.source_namespace</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Appends provenance tags.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Returns <computeroutput>StageResult</computeroutput> with <computeroutput>StageStatus::Success</computeroutput> and populated <computeroutput>candidates</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>On error:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>If <computeroutput>fail_open = false</computeroutput> (default): returns <computeroutput>StageStatus::Error</computeroutput> + diagnostic.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>If <computeroutput>fail_open = true</computeroutput>: returns <computeroutput>StageStatus::Skipped</computeroutput> + diagnostic.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>ctx</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Mutable pipeline context; <computeroutput>ctx.query</computeroutput> is the input text. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Stage result with wiki candidates (or skipped on error).</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="inout">ctx</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Input/output parameter. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Return value.</para>
</simplesect>
Calls: std::chrono::steady_clock::now(), isReady(), spdlog::warn(), provenanceTag(), query(), reserve(), size(), push_back(). </para>
        </detaileddescription>
